  "prologue": [
    "Su for Sujata, Ta for Taniya. Two sisters, one word: suta, the Sanskrit for thread.",
    "This almanac follows that thread through one festive season, from the morning the dhaak announces Durga to the quiet evening after Diwali when someone finally sits down to read. Six chapters, six of Suta's own collections, twenty-four looks. Every piece is in the store, at the price you see here."
